    "body": "This doesn't seem correct. Can you state more about the motivation for these changes?\r\n\r\nWe only include events in the global index that are fired by HTML, as the text there states. beforeinput is not fired by HTML, so it is not included.\r\n\r\nAnd there's no reason to remove the events you tried to remove. At least, you didn't give any.\r\n\r\nI'll close this, but happy to discuss more in the closed thread.",
