    "updated_at": "2022-10-26T11:11:09Z",
    "body": "`beforeinput` was added *to `GlobalEventHandlers`*, but HTML does not fire it, so including it in the event index is incorrect.\r\n\r\n`abort` *stopped being fired*, but it is still in `GlobalEventHandlers` and user agents must still support content attributes for it. So removing it from those locations is incorrect.",
